      "side": 1,
      "message": "FYI, the no-3A setting comes from the [corsola ITE base config](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/program/corsola/ite_program.conf;l\u003d65;drc\u003dbd46523a00f5121b1f4165e6bd307457d8fd6c38), and the only model that overrides that is wugtrio. If we make VIFs for more corsola ITE variants, they\u0027ll also have this slightly unusual setup.\n\nsquirtle and steelix are NPCX variants, so they have the typical single 3A port and the typical VIF settings. You can check the chip of a variant in the [build file](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/program/corsola/BUILD.py).",
      "revId": "72ffe734129a6b1e3f6a6dd3989c89a28f012c8d",
